        "        \"Compresses spacetime in front, expands behind (NASA Eagleworks).\",\n",
        "        \"Harvests energy from quantum vacuum fluctuations (EmDrive-like).\",\n",
        "        \"Miniaturized nuclear explosions for thrust (Project Orion).\",\n",
