      "source": [
        "### Heteroscedasticity Check: Residuals vs. Actual Power\n",
        "We plot residuals against the ground truth (Actual Power) to see if the variance of the errors is independent of the target value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 325
        },
